
% Gives You Hell

a: I | vi | IV |
In: $a*2
Ch: $a*2
link: $a*2
Vr_2: $a*2
Vr: $a*4
PCh: V | vi | V | IV |
a_sub: I | V | IV |
Ch_2: $a*3 $a_sub
b: vi | IV | I | iii . . ii | . . I . |
b_turnaround: vi | vio | ii | V |
bridge: $b $b_turnaround
c: I | IV | vi | V | I |
Ch_3: $c*2
turnaround: vi | V | I |
ending: $turnaround*2
S: [E] $In $Vr $Ch $Vr $PCh $Ch_2 $link $Vr_2 $PCh $Ch_2 $bridge $Ch_3*2 $ending
